SUMMARY:Slime Lab: Hands-On STEM Workshop Series
DESCRIPTION:November brings starry slime and cosmic charms!\nJoin us for a 30-minute guided hands-on workshop where participants will create their own slime. Learn how a few simple ingredients come together to make this stretchy- squishy favorite! Workshops will take place twice each scheduled day\, so choose the time that works best for you! \nTickets on sale now!!\nRequired Age: 6+ (adult supervision required)\nWorkshop Fee: $9 per slime-making kit\nCapacity: 24 participants per session \n1:00 session tickets \n3:00 session tickets \nPlease Note: A paid workshop ticket is required for each participant. \nAdmission is required. Workshop fees are separate from admission and are not included with any admission type or program. Please plan to either purchase timed entry tickets\, purchase tickets at the door\, or use one of our free admission programs. \nAdvance registration is recommended\, as space is limited to 24 participants per session. \nMembers: don’t forget to sign in to get your 10% member discount!
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/16633-4/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/Slime-Nov-FEATURE-1920-x-1080-2026.png
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
