SUMMARY:Science in ACTION! with Millersville University Chemistry Club
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for chemistry to come alive!\nJoin the Millersville University Chemistry Club for exciting live demonstrations that turn science into a show. Explore surprising reactions\, cool chemistry\, and plenty of WOW moments as you discover what happens when chemistry is put into action! \nThis activity is FREE with your paid admission or membership to the Lancaster Science Factory.
