SUMMARY:BubbleMania feat. Casey Carle\, Presented by: ABA Centers of Pennsylvania
DESCRIPTION:BubbleMania: Science\, Art\, Comedy with Casey Carle\nPresented by ABA Centers of Pennsylvania \nCasey Carle\, comic bubbleologist will perform his amazing one-man show BubbleMania! This show features giant floating spheres\, soap-film “serpents\,” bouncing bubbles\, cube bubbles\, the Crystal Ball; the spinning Bubble Spacecraft\, and so much more! \nNovember 27 and November 28\, 2026 Showtimes are the same on both days. \nShowtimes: \n11:00 \n12:00 \n1:30 \n2:30 \nBubbleMania show tickets are $3/ person in addition to general admission. Lancaster Science Factory members receive 10% off the BubbleMania show tickets. General admission is required to attend BubbleMania shows.
