SUMMARY:First Friday @ The Lancaster Science Factory!
DESCRIPTION:Every First Friday the Lancaster Science Factory offers free admission from 5 – 7pm for the first 300 guests. Explore over 80 interactive exhibits for kids in grades K – 8 and their families! This program is possible through the generous support of PPL. \nAll children must be accompanied by an adult. To make the most of your experience\, we recommend 1 adult for every 5 kids during your First Friday visit.
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/first-friday-the-lancaster-science-factory-2-2-2/2027-09-03/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Special Programs
